=== setup schema
--- source
type Note { id: Key notes } = Plain { body: Text } | Link { url: Text }
relation notes : Note key id generate sequence
=== link run
--- source
insert notes.Link { id: notes.key(1), url: "u" }
=== reject restricted-old-key
--- source
insert notes.Plain { id: notes.key(1), body: "x" }
unless conflict on key else fail "the conflict branch ran"
--- old-type
Note.Plain
--- relation
notes
--- key
notes.key(1)
